## Components Overview
- **UI Primitives**: `components/ui/*` provide buttons, inputs, dialogs, popovers, etc. Prefer these for consistency and accessibility.
- **Chat**: `components/chat.tsx`, `components/chat-panel.tsx`, `components/chat-messages.tsx`, and related message components structure the chat experience.
- **Artifacts**: `components/artifact/*` renders tool/agent outputs (search results, retrieved content, reasoning, video results).
- **Sidebar**: `components/sidebar/*` handles chat history and actions.
- **Auth Forms**: `components/login-form.tsx`, `components/sign-up-form.tsx`, `components/update-password-form.tsx`, `components/forgot-password-form.tsx`.

## Usage Notes
- Prefer composition over extending primitives; wrap `components/ui/*` in domain components when needed.
- Keep presentation in components; place complex logic in `lib/*` and pass results via props.
- Use `components/ui/markdown.tsx` for rendering rich text content where needed.

